// ============================================================================
// track_100k.rs -- wave13_parity
//
// The 100k track is now ONLY its constants.  Every line of the solver lives in
// `round_engine.rs`, which the four tracks share, so no optimisation can be
// present on one track and missing on another.  Generated by make_engine.py;
// every constant below was READ OUT of challengers/submission002_fastbok/
// track_100k.rs (the 20k) resp. the wave12_port merge (the three ports), so
// this file changes nothing about what the track computes.
// ============================================================================
